# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} [[fucking hell]]!, [[holy shit]]!, [[what the fuck]]!

====Usage notes====
{{m|ru|ппц}}, pronounced as {{m|ru|пипе́ц}}, is understood among people familiar with phones and PCs.

{{cln|ru|swear words}}

==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|3.14зда||texting slang}}

===Etymology===
{{etymon|ru|:inh|orv:пизда́|tree=+}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|пизда|пизда́}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*pīzdà}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*pīˀsdāˀ}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*písdeh₂}}.
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*sed-}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|пизда́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-Pizda.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-пизда́.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|d|пизда́|or|d|||пёзд|a=bi|dim=пиздёнка|aug=пизди́ща,пизди́ще}}

# {{lb|ru|obscene|swear word|taboo|_|slang}} [[pussy]], [[cunt]], [[twat]]
